From 5d6a80867c82851158a1ad82952d816e06dcd6a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ReArc Overlay <overlay@rearc.invalid>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 09:40:00 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 wave 18c: route file choosers and download save
 paths to the host

Expose open, multiple, upload folder, open directory and save modes with accept types. Complete Chromium FileSelectListener with host paths or cancellation. Enumerate folders off-thread without symlink traversal; bound paths and file counts. Route download confirmations through the same save panel when registered. ABI 1.19 / bridge 0.21.0. Build p56 and native files host pass.

Last rebased: 2026-11-04 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
